Package: Rsurrogate
Type: Package
Title: Robust Estimation of the Proportion of Treatment Effect Explained by Surrogate Marker Information
Version: 3.3
Authors@R: c(person("Layla", "Parast", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "parast@austin.utexas.edu"))
Maintainer: Layla Parast <parast@austin.utexas.edu>
Description: Provides functions to estimate the proportion of treatment effect on the primary outcome that is explained by the treatment effect on the surrogate marker. A tutorial for this package can be found at
  <https://github.com/laylaparast/Rsurrogate> and a Shiny App 
  implementing the package can be found at 
  <https://parastlab.shinyapps.io/RSurrogateApp/>.
License: GPL
Imports: stats, survival, Matrix, glmnet


